<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Stainless Heart"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="不锈之心"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Alan Day"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Monster Siren Records"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Obadiah Brown-Beach"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="塞壬唱片-MSR"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Stainless Heart"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Stainless Heart - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="不锈之心"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="TWU712205139"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1985642223"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="004OdfQQ127COx"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="378374685"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4tIpqjxBeooiUC0bbUY0FV"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1648462516"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:10.760"><div begin="14.450" end="4:10.760"><p begin="14.450" end="17.280" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.450" end="14.660">I</span> <span begin="14.660" end="14.880">can</span> <span begin="14.880" end="15.120">feel</span> <span begin="15.120" end="15.210">the</span> <span begin="15.320" end="15.530">gear</span><span begin="15.530" end="15.600">s</span> <span begin="15.600" end="15.720">they&apos;re</span> <span begin="15.800" end="16.000">tur</span><span begin="16.000" end="16.200">ning</span> <span begin="16.200" end="16.500">fa</span><span begin="16.500" end="16.680">s</span><span begin="16.680" end="17.280">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能感受到齿轮正愈转愈快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我能感受到齒輪正愈轉愈快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">歯車がますます速く回り出すのを感じる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">톱니바퀴가 점점 더 빠르게 돌아가는 게 느껴져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je sens les engrenages tourner de plus en plus vite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siento que los engranajes giran cada vez más rápido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich spüre wie die Zahnräder sich immer schneller drehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto as engrenagens girando cada vez mais rápido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я чувствую как шестерни вращаются всё быстрее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sento gli ingranaggi girare sempre più in fretta</span></p><p begin="17.930" end="20.920" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.930" end="18.260">Grin</span><span begin="18.260" end="18.450">ding</span> <span begin="18.450" end="18.710">down</span> <span begin="18.710" end="18.890">the</span> <span begin="18.890" end="19.100">on</span><span begin="19.100" end="19.370">ly</span> <span begin="19.370" end="19.530">ho</span><span begin="19.610" end="19.690">pe</span> <span begin="19.690" end="20.010">we</span> <span begin="20.010" end="20.760">ha</span><span begin="20.760" end="20.920">ve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我们仅存的希望一点点碾碎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將我們僅存的希望一點點碾碎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちに残された唯一の希望さえ 磨り潰しながら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 가진 유일한 희망을 갈아 버리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Broyant le seul espoir qu&apos;il nous reste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desgastando la única esperanza que nos queda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die einzige Hoffnung zermalmen die uns noch bleibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esmagando a única esperança que nos resta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Перемалывая нашу последнюю надежду</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Stritolando l&apos;unica speranza che ci resta</span></p><p begin="21.540" end="25.390" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.540" end="21.780">No</span> <span begin="21.780" end="21.980">one</span> <span begin="21.980" end="22.240">could</span> <span begin="22.240" end="22.420">have</span> <span begin="22.420" end="22.570">p</span><span begin="22.570" end="22.780">lanned</span> <span begin="22.870" end="23.350">for</span> <span begin="23.350" end="23.570">thi</span><span begin="23.570" end="23.760">s</span> <span begin="23.760" end="24.070">di</span><span begin="24.070" end="24.240">s</span><span begin="24.240" end="24.520">a</span><span begin="24.520" end="24.680">s</span><span begin="24.680" end="25.390">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁也未曾料到这场浩劫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">誰也未曾料到這場浩劫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">こんな惨劇を誰が予想できただろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누구도 이런 재앙에 대비할 수 없었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Personne n&apos;aurait pu prévoir ce désastre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nadie podría haber previsto este desastre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Niemand hätte diese Katastrophe vorhersehen können</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ninguém poderia ter previsto este desastre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Никто не мог предвидеть эту катастрофу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nessuno avrebbe potuto prevedere questa catastrofe</span></p><p begin="28.200" end="30.360" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.200" end="28.490">But</span> <span begin="28.490" end="28.700">i</span><span begin="28.810" end="28.950">f</span> <span begin="28.950" end="29.340">we</span> <span begin="29.340" end="30.210">ri</span><span begin="30.210" end="30.360">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但只要我们挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但只要我們挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも俺たちが立ち上がり</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 우리가 일어선다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais si nous nous relevons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero si nos alzamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch wenn wir uns erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas se nos erguermos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но если мы восстанем</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma se ci rialziamo</span></p><p begin="30.600" end="34.020" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.600" end="30.760">And</span> <span begin="30.840" end="31.140">ju</span><span begin="31.140" end="31.300">s</span><span begin="31.300" end="31.390">t</span> <span begin="31.390" end="31.590">o</span><span begin="31.760" end="32.020">pe</span><span begin="32.020" end="32.260">n u</span><span begin="32.410" end="32.870">p ou</span><span begin="32.870" end="33.840">r eye</span><span begin="33.840" end="34.020">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">睜開雙眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その目を見開きさえすれば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 두 눈을 활짝 뜬다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ouvrons simplement les yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y simplemente abrimos los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und einfach unsere Augen öffnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E simplesmente abrirmos os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И просто откроем глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E apriamo finalmente gli occhi</span></p><p begin="35.280" end="39.390" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.280" end="35.370">The</span> <span begin="35.550" end="35.990">pain</span> <span begin="35.990" end="36.240">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="36.240" end="36.430">s</span><span begin="36.430" end="36.710">to</span><span begin="36.870" end="37.170">p u</span><span begin="37.170" end="37.330">s</span> <span begin="37.330" end="37.460">from</span> <span begin="37.560" end="37.850">get</span><span begin="37.850" end="38.250">ting</span> <span begin="38.250" end="39.180">ou</span><span begin="39.180" end="39.390">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦痛便无法阻止我们冲出重围</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">苦痛便無法阻止我們衝出重圍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どんな痛みも 俺たちの脱出を阻めはしない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고통도 우리가 벗어나는 걸 막지 못해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La douleur ne nous empêchera pas de nous en sortir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El dolor no nos impedirá salir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird der Schmerz uns nicht daran hindern hier herauszukommen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A dor não vai nos impedir de escapar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Боль не помешает нам выбраться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il dolore non ci impedirà di venirne fuori</span></p><p begin="41.320" end="42.460" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.320" end="41.470">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="41.570" end="41.790">thin</span><span begin="41.790" end="41.880">k a</span><span begin="42.000" end="42.460">bout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再想着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">別再想著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">考えるな</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생각하지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne te contente pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te conformes con</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denk nicht daran</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não se contente em</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже не думай</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non pensare a</span></p><p begin="42.840" end="43.720" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.840" end="43.130">Hol</span><span begin="43.130" end="43.360">ding</span> <span begin="43.360" end="43.720">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一味苦撑下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一味苦撐下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ただ耐え忍ぶことなど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 버티기만 하는 건</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De tenir bon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Seguir resistiendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch länger auszuharren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas resistir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О том чтобы просто выжидать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resistere e basta</span></p><p begin="44.020" end="45.550" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.020" end="44.110">The</span> <span begin="44.230" end="44.460">time</span> <span begin="44.460" end="44.570">i</span><span begin="44.570" end="44.690">s</span> <span begin="44.690" end="44.910">now</span> <span begin="44.910" end="45.120">or</span> <span begin="45.120" end="45.350">ne</span><span begin="45.350" end="45.550">ver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要么就在此刻 要么永远错过</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">要麼就在此刻 要麼永遠錯過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">やるなら今だ 今を逃せば二度とない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금이 아니면 기회는 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est maintenant ou jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es ahora o nunca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt oder nie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É agora ou nunca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сейчас или никогда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il momento è ora o mai più</span></p><p begin="45.770" end="47.340" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.770" end="46.000">We</span> <span begin="46.000" end="46.220">hol</span><span begin="46.220" end="46.430">d it</span> <span begin="46.430" end="46.660">all</span> <span begin="46.660" end="46.760">to</span><span begin="46.880" end="47.140">ge</span><span begin="47.140" end="47.340">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们携手守住这一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們攜手守住這一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちの手で すべてを支え抜くんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 함께 모든 걸 지켜 낼 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ensemble nous maintenons tout debout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo mantenemos todo unido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gemeinsam halten wir alles zusammen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntos mantemos tudo de pé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вместе мы удержим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Insieme teniamo tutto in piedi</span></p><p begin="47.530" end="49.270" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.530" end="47.800">We</span> <span begin="47.800" end="48.010">have</span> <span begin="48.010" end="48.120">the</span> <span begin="48.200" end="48.440">po</span><span begin="48.440" end="48.640">wer</span> <span begin="48.640" end="48.870">to</span> <span begin="48.870" end="49.200">ri</span><span begin="49.200" end="49.270">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们拥有奋起反抗的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們擁有奮起反抗的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちには立ち上がる力がある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리에게는 일어설 힘이 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous avons la force de nous relever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tenemos la fuerza para alzarnos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir haben die Kraft uns zu erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Temos a força para nos erguer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У нас есть силы восстать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo la forza di rialzarci</span></p><p begin="49.330" end="51.160" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.330" end="49.550">Count</span> <span begin="49.550" end="49.800">down</span> <span begin="49.800" end="50.020">the</span> <span begin="50.020" end="50.250">ho</span><span begin="50.250" end="50.370">ur</span><span begin="50.370" end="50.470">s</span> <span begin="50.470" end="50.670">&apos;ti</span><span begin="50.670" end="51.160">l I</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒数着分秒 直到我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倒數著分秒 直到我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その時が来るまで 残された時間を数える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 나설 때까지 남은 시간을 세어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je compte les heures jusqu&apos;à ce que je</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuenta las horas hasta que yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zähl die Stunden bis ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Conte as horas até eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отсчитывай часы до того как я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Conto le ore fino al momento in cui</span></p><p begin="51.690" end="56.510" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.690" end="51.790">C</span><span begin="51.790" end="52.060">ra</span><span begin="52.060" end="52.260">sh</span> <span begin="52.260" end="52.450">it</span> <span begin="52.640" end="52.970">down</span> <span begin="53.080" end="53.240">ju</span><span begin="53.240" end="53.340">st</span> <span begin="53.340" end="53.430">to</span> <span begin="53.540" end="53.820">bring</span> <span begin="53.820" end="54.030">it</span> <span begin="54.210" end="54.660">back</span> <span begin="54.830" end="55.120">to</span> <span begin="55.120" end="56.320">li</span><span begin="56.320" end="56.510">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手将它击碎 只为令其重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親手將它擊碎 只為令其重獲新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべてを叩き壊し 再び命を吹き込むために</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 되살리기 위해 모조리 무너뜨릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fasse tout s&apos;effondrer pour lui redonner vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo derribe solo para devolverle la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles niederreiße nur um es wieder zum Leben zu erwecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Derrubar tudo só para trazê-lo de volta à vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрушу всё лишь затем чтобы вернуть к жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbatterò tutto solo per riportarlo in vita</span></p><p begin="57.080" end="1:00.610" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.080" end="57.490">Fa</span><span begin="57.490" end="57.600">ce</span> <span begin="57.750" end="57.860">to</span> <span begin="57.970" end="58.400">fa</span><span begin="58.400" end="58.520">ce</span> <span begin="58.640" end="58.770">wi</span><span begin="58.770" end="58.870">th</span> <span begin="58.870" end="59.220">the</span> <span begin="59.320" end="59.640">ma</span><span begin="59.760" end="1:00.610">chine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与那庞然巨械正面相对</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與那龐然巨械正面相對</span><span 