ans">永远年轻 永远自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">永遠年輕 永遠自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">いつまでも若く 自由なまま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">영원히 젊고 자유롭게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À jamais jeunes et libres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por siempre jóvenes y libres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Für immer jung und frei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para sempre jovens e livres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Навеки молоды и свободны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per sempre giovani e liberi</span></span></p><p begin="1:36.180" end="1:38.760" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.180" end="1:36.380">Rea</span><span begin="1:36.380" end="1:36.540">ching</span> <span begin="1:36.640" end="1:36.850">for</span> <span begin="1:36.850" end="1:37.050">the</span> <span begin="1:37.050" end="1:37.260">hand</span> <span begin="1:37.340" end="1:37.510">that</span> <span begin="1:37.510" end="1:37.760">hol</span><span begin="1:37.760" end="1:37.830">ds</span> <span begin="1:37.830" end="1:37.990">u</span><span begin="1:37.990" end="1:38.200">s</span> <span begin="1:38.200" end="1:38.760">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸手抓向那只将我们死死压制的手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">伸手抓向那隻將我們死死壓制的手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちを押さえつけるその手へと 手を伸ばす</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리를 짓누르는 손을 향해 손을 뻗으며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je tends la main vers celle qui nous maintient à terre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Intentando alcanzar la mano que nos mantiene sometidos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich greife nach der Hand die uns niederhält</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tentando alcançar a mão que nos mantém presos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тянусь к руке, что прижимает нас к земле</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cercando di afferrare la mano che ci tiene schiacciati</span></p><p begin="1:39.740" end="1:42.140" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.740" end="1:40.000">Fear</span> <span begin="1:40.000" end="1:40.130">can</span> <span begin="1:40.220" end="1:40.470">turn</span> <span begin="1:40.470" end="1:40.730">you</span> <span begin="1:40.730" end="1:40.890">in</span><span begin="1:40.890" end="1:41.090">to</span> <span begin="1:41.090" end="1:41.220">a</span> <span begin="1:41.340" end="1:41.640">mon</span><span begin="1:41.640" end="1:41.800">s</span><span begin="1:41.800" end="1:42.140">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恐惧能将你变成怪物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">恐懼能將你變成怪物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖は人を怪物へと変えてしまう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움은 널 괴물로 만들 수도 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La peur peut faire de toi un monstre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El miedo puede convertirte en un monstruo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Angst kann dich in ein Monster verwandeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O medo pode transformar você num monstro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Страх может превратить тебя в чудовище</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La paura può trasformarti in un mostro</span></p><p begin="1:42.440" end="1:44.040" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.440" end="1:42.650">In</span><span begin="1:42.650" end="1:42.900">to</span> <span begin="1:42.900" end="1:43.010">a</span> <span begin="1:43.130" end="1:43.560">mar</span><span begin="1:43.560" end="1:44.040">tyr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能让你沦为殉道者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也能讓你淪為殉道者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あるいは殉教者へと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순교자로 만들 수도 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un martyr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En un mártir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einen Märtyrer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Num mártir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В мученика</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un martire</span></p><p begin="1:45.290" end="1:48.560" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.290" end="1:45.420">But</span> <span begin="1:45.510" end="1:45.640">ju</span><span begin="1:45.640" end="1:45.790">st</span> <span begin="1:45.790" end="1:45.970">re</span><span begin="1:45.970" end="1:46.210">mem</span><span begin="1:46.210" end="1:46.440">ber</span> <span begin="1:46.440" end="1:46.690">that</span> <span begin="1:46.690" end="1:46.900">i</span><span begin="1:47.000" end="1:47.120">f</span> <span begin="1:47.120" end="1:47.510">we</span> <span begin="1:47.510" end="1:48.310">ri</span><span begin="1:48.310" end="1:48.560">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请记住 只要我们挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但請記住 只要我們挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だが忘れるな 俺たちが立ち上がり</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 기억해 우리가 일어선다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais rappelle-toi que si nous nous relevons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero recuerda que si nos alzamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch denk immer daran wenn wir uns erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas lembre-se de que se nos erguermos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но помни что если мы восстанем</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma ricorda soltanto che se ci rialziamo</span></p><p begin="1:48.840" end="1:52.350" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.840" end="1:48.940">And</span> <span begin="1:49.060" end="1:49.350">ju</span><span begin="1:49.350" end="1:49.500">s</span><span begin="1:49.500" end="1:49.590">t</span> <span begin="1:49.590" end="1:49.820">o</span><span begin="1:49.970" end="1:50.230">pe</span><span begin="1:50.230" end="1:50.480">n u</span><span begin="1:50.650" end="1:51.080">p ou</span><span begin="1:51.080" end="1:52.110">r eye</span><span begin="1:52.110" end="1:52.350">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">睜開雙眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その目を見開きさえすれば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 두 눈을 활짝 뜬다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ouvrons simplement les yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y simplemente abrimos los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und einfach unsere Augen öffnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E simplesmente abrirmos os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И просто откроем глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E apriamo finalmente gli occhi</span></p><p begin="1:53.520" end="1:55.540" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.520" end="1:53.640">The</span> <span begin="1:53.770" end="1:54.100">pain</span> <span begin="1:54.190" end="1:54.490">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:54.490" end="1:54.680">s</span><span begin="1:54.680" end="1:54.950">to</span><span begin="1:55.100" end="1:55.420">p u</span><span begin="1:55.420" end="1:55.540">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦痛便无法阻挡我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">苦痛便無法阻擋我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どんな痛みも俺たちを止められない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고통도 우릴 막지 못해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La douleur ne peut nous arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El dolor no puede detenernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann der Schmerz uns nicht aufhalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A dor não pode nos deter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Боль не сможет нас остановить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il dolore non può fermarci</span></p><p begin="1:55.790" end="1:57.250" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.790" end="1:56.010">Ne</span><span begin="1:56.110" end="1:56.440">ver</span> <span begin="1:56.440" end="1:56.870">no</span><span begin="1:56.870" end="1:57.160">t u</span><span begin="1:57.160" end="1:57.250">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们绝不会就此倒下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們絕不會就此倒下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちだけは 決して屈しない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 절대 굴복하지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pas nous jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Jamás podrá con nosotros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nein uns niemals</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A nós jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Только не нас никогда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non noi mai e poi mai</span></p><p begin="1:57.470" end="2:02.280" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.470" end="1:57.590">C</span><span begin="1:57.590" end="1:57.840">ra</span><span begin="1:57.840" end="1:58.040">sh</span> <span begin="1:58.040" end="1:58.220">it</span> <span begin="1:58.410" end="1:58.750">down</span> <span begin="1:58.870" end="1:59.010">ju</span><span begin="1:59.010" end="1:59.120">st</span> <span begin="1:59.120" end="1:59.210">to</span> <span begin="1:59.310" end="1:59.580">bring</span> <span begin="1:59.580" end="1:59.810">it</span> <span begin="1:59.990" end="2:00.440">back</span> <span begin="2:00.640" end="2:00.910">to</span> <span begin="2:00.910" end="2:02.100">li</span><span begin="2:02.100" end="2:02.280">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手将它击碎 只为令其重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親手將它擊碎 只為令其重獲新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべてを叩き壊し 再び命を吹き込むんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 되살리기 위해 모조리 무너뜨릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout faire s&apos;effondrer pour lui redonner vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo derribaré solo para devolverle la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles niederreißen nur um es wieder zum Leben zu erwecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Derrubar tudo só para trazê-lo de volta à vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрушу всё лишь затем чтобы вернуть к жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbatterò tutto solo per riportarlo in vita</span></p><p begin="2:01.090" end="2:04.590" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.090" end="2:01.490">Fa</span><span begin="2:01.490" end="2:01.600">ce</span> <span begin="2:01.750" end="2:01.900">to</span> <span begin="2:02.000" end="2:02.400">fa</span><span begin="2:02.400" end="2:02.520">ce</span> <span begin="2:02.630" end="2:02.770">wi</span><span begin="2:02.770" end="2:02.870">th</span> <span begin="2:02.870" end="2:03.220">the</span> <span begin="2:03.320" end="2:03.640">ma</span><span begin="2:03.740" end="2:04.590">chine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与那庞然巨械正面相对</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與那龐然巨械正面相對</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">鋼鉄の機械と真正面から対峙する</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기계와 정면으로 맞서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Face à face avec la machine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Frente a frente con la máquina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Maschine Auge in Auge gegenüberstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cara a cara com a máquina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лицом к лицу с машиной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Faccia a faccia con la macchina</span></p><p begin="2:05.500" end="2:08.040" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.500" end="2:05.700">Thi</span><span begin="2:05.700" end="2:05.790">s</span> <span begin="2:05.790" end="2:05.900">i</span><span begin="2:05.900" end="2:06.000">s</span> <span begin="2:06.000" end="2:06.220">where</span> <span begin="2:06.220" end="2:06.350">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="2:06.430" end="2:06.750">born</span> <span begin="2:06.860" end="2:07.140">to</span> <span begin="2:07.320" end="2:08.040">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这里便是我生来注定的战场</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這裡便是我生來注定的戰場</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この場所に立つために 俺は生まれた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 바로 이 자리에 서기 위해 태어났어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis né pour être ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nací para estar aquí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hierfür bin ich geboren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu nasci para estar aqui</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Именно здесь мне суждено быть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono nato per essere qui</span></p><p begin="2:08.670" end="2:11.790" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.670" end="2:10.000">Woah</span> <span begin="2:10.430" end="2:11.790">woah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 喔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">喔 喔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ウォー ウォー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">워어 워어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ô ô</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О-о о-о</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="2:12.850" end="2:14.980" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.850" end="2:13.120">For</span><span begin="2:13.120" end="2:13.350">e</span><span begin="2:13.350" end="2:13.570">ver</span> <span begin="2:13.570" end="2:13.880">young</span> <span begin="2:14.000" end="2:14.290">and</span> <span begin="2:14.440" end="2:14.980">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远年轻 永远自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">永遠年輕 永遠自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">いつまでも若く 自由なまま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">영원히 젊고 자유롭게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À jamais jeunes et libres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por siempre jóvenes y libres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Für immer jung und frei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para sempre jovens e livres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Навеки молоды и свободны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per sempre giovani e liberi</span></p><p begin="2:15.290" end="2:18.840" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.290" end="2:15.770">You</span> <span begin="2:15.950" end="2:16.090">and</span> <span begin="2:16.210" end="2:16.650">me</span> <span begin="2:16.880" end="2:17.070">we</span> <span begin="2:17.070" end="2:17.450">found</span> <span begin="2:17.540" end="2:17.890">the</span> <span begin="2:17.980" end="2:18.840">key</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我已找到了那把钥匙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你與我已找到了那把鑰匙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前と俺は 未来を開く鍵を見つけた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너와 나 우린 마침내 열쇠를 찾아냈어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toi et moi nous avons trouvé la clé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú y yo encontramos la llave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du und ich wir haben den Schlüssel gefunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você e eu encontramos a chave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты и я мы нашли ключ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu e io abbiamo trovato la chiave</span></p><p begin="2:19.530" end="2:22.460" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.530" end="2:19.640">From</span> <span begin="2:19.730" end="2:20.020">craw</span><span begin="2:20.020" end="2:20.240">ling</span> <span begin="2:20.240" end="2:20.460">on</span> <span begin="2:20.460" end="2:20.680">our</span> <span begin="2:20.680" end="2:21.080">han</span><span begin="2:21.080" end="2:21.140">ds</span> <span begin="2:21.140" end="2:21.390">and</span> <span begin="2:21.540" end="2:22.350">knee</span><span begin="2:22.350" end="2:22.460">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得以摆脱曾经屈膝匍匐的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">得以擺脫曾經屈膝匍匐的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">両手と膝をつき 這いつくばった日々の果てに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두 손과 무릎으로 바닥을 기어 다니던 때부터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Après avoir rampé à quatre pattes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tras arrastrarnos a cuatro patas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vom Kriechen auf Händen und Knien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Rastejando de mãos e joelhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ползая на руках и коленях</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dopo aver strisciato su mani e ginocchia</span></p><p begin="2:22.890" end="2:26.