 눈을 활짝 뜬다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ouvrons simplement les yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y simplemente abrimos los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und einfach unsere Augen öffnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E simplesmente abrirmos os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И просто откроем глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E apriamo finalmente gli occhi</span></p><p begin="2:57.510" end="2:59.520" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.510" end="2:57.620">The</span> <span begin="2:57.770" end="2:58.070">pain</span> <span begin="2:58.190" end="2:58.500">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:58.500" end="2:58.700">s</span><span begin="2:58.700" end="2:58.940">to</span><span begin="2:59.110" end="2:59.400">p u</span><span begin="2:59.400" end="2:59.520">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦痛便无法阻挡我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">苦痛便無法阻擋我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どんな痛みも俺たちを止められない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고통도 우릴 막지 못해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La douleur ne peut nous arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El dolor no puede detenernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann der Schmerz uns nicht aufhalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A dor não pode nos deter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Боль не сможет нас остановить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il dolore non può fermarci</span></p><p begin="2:59.790" end="3:01.240" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.790" end="3:00.000">Ne</span><span begin="3:00.100" end="3:00.350">ver</span> <span begin="3:00.450" end="3:00.870">no</span><span begin="3:00.870" end="3:01.150">t u</span><span begin="3:01.150" end="3:01.240">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们绝不会就此倒下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們絕不會就此倒下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちだけは 決して屈しない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 절대 굴복하지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pas nous jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Jamás podrá con nosotros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nein uns niemals</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A nós jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Только не нас никогда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non noi mai e poi mai</span></p><p begin="3:01.470" end="3:06.280" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.470" end="3:01.570">C</span><span begin="3:01.570" end="3:01.850">ra</span><span begin="3:01.850" end="3:02.030">sh</span> <span begin="3:02.030" end="3:02.220">it</span> <span begin="3:02.420" end="3:02.740">down</span> <span begin="3:02.860" end="3:03.010">ju</span><span begin="3:03.010" end="3:03.120">st</span> <span begin="3:03.120" end="3:03.200">to</span> <span begin="3:03.310" end="3:03.590">bring</span> <span begin="3:03.590" end="3:03.800">it</span> <span begin="3:04.000" end="3:04.440">back</span> <span begin="3:04.640" end="3:04.890">to</span> <span begin="3:04.890" end="3:06.070">li</span><span begin="3:06.070" end="3:06.280">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手将它击碎 只为令其重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親手將它擊碎 只為令其重獲新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべてを叩き壊し 再び命を吹き込むんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 되살리기 위해 모조리 무너뜨릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout faire s&apos;effondrer pour lui redonner vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo derribaré solo para devolverle la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles niederreißen nur um es wieder zum Leben zu erwecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Derrubar tudo só para trazê-lo de volta à vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрушу всё лишь затем чтобы вернуть к жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbatterò tutto solo per riportarlo in vita</span></p><p begin="3:06.850" end="3:10.360" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.850" end="3:07.270">Fa</span><span begin="3:07.270" end="3:07.390">ce</span> <span begin="3:07.530" end="3:07.630">to</span> <span begin="3:07.750" end="3:08.200">fa</span><span begin="3:08.200" end="3:08.290">ce</span> <span begin="3:08.430" end="3:08.540">with</span> <span begin="3:08.650" end="3:09.000">the</span> <span begin="3:09.100" end="3:09.400">ma</span><span begin="3:09.540" end="3:10.360">chine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与那庞然巨械正面相对</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與那龐然巨械正面相對</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">鋼鉄の機械と真正面から対峙する</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기계와 정면으로 맞서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Face à face avec la machine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Frente a frente con la máquina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Maschine Auge in Auge gegenüberstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cara a cara com a máquina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лицом к лицу с машиной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Faccia a faccia con la macchina</span></p><p begin="3:11.280" end="3:13.820" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.280" end="3:11.480">Thi</span><span begin="3:11.480" end="3:11.570">s</span> <span begin="3:11.570" end="3:11.680">i</span><span begin="3:11.680" end="3:11.770">s</span> <span begin="3:11.770" end="3:11.980">where</span> <span begin="3:11.980" end="3:12.120">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:12.210" end="3:12.550">born</span> <span begin="3:12.630" end="3:12.920">to</spa